    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "api_express_text",
      "x": 65, "y": 845,
      "width": 250, "height": 70,
      "text": "Express.js API 路由\nGET /api/food/search       食物搜索\nPOST /api/food/analyze       营养分析\nPOST /api/food/analyze-image  多源识别\nPOST /api/food/cache/correct  用户校正\nPOST /api/food/portion-feedback 份量反馈\nGET /api/food/weight-mapping 克重映射",
      "originalText": "Express.js API 路由\nGET /api/food/search       食物搜索\nPOST /api/food/analyze       营养分析\nPOST /api/food/analyze-image  多源识别\nPOST /api/food/cache/correct  用户校正\nPOST /api/food/portion-feedback 份量反馈\nGET /api/food/weight-mapping 克重映射",
